By this point, we could still have two lease holders. I think what we should do is:
renewalDur := renewInterval + extendTimeout
if time.Now().Add(renewalDur) > expiry {
    // lease lost
}

In other words, if the max time it could take to renew the lease would fall outside of the bounds of our expiry, we are no longer safe and should give up retrying and assume the lease is lost.
